msgstr "Táto adresa sa uchováva tak, ako je napísaná. Ak ju chcete zmeniť na krátky tvar, zadajte do poľa samotné meno."

#: src/postulo/templates/partials/confirm_delete.html
msgid "This also deletes:"
msgstr "Toto vymaže aj:"

#: src/postulo/templates/applications/partials/timeline.html
msgid "This application"
msgstr "Táto žiadosť"

#: src/postulo/templates/settings/capture.html
msgid "This applies to the captures made from now on. What has been kept stays until you delete it, from the capture's own page; what was not kept cannot be fetched back."
msgstr "Platí to pre zachytenia vytvorené odteraz. To, čo sa uchovalo, zostáva, kým to nevymažete na stránke samotného zachytenia; čo sa neuchovalo, sa nedá získať späť."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/backup_restore.html
msgid "This archive carries no signature. It was written before archives were signed, or its signature was removed by whoever altered it, and the two cannot be told apart. Restore it only if you know where it has been; the command below asks for <code>--unverified</code> for that reason."
msgstr "Tento archív nemá podpis. Bol vytvorený pred zavedením podpisovania archívov alebo jeho podpis odstránil ten, kto ho zmenil, a tieto dve možnosti sa nedajú rozlíšiť. Obnovte ho, iba ak viete, kde bol; príkaz nižšie preto vyžaduje <code>--unverified</code>."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/backup_restore.html
msgid "This archive does not verify, so do not restore from it."
msgstr "Tento archív neprešiel overením, takže z neho neobnovujte."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/backup_restore.html
#, python-format
msgid "This archive holds a %(there)s database and this instance runs %(here)s. A restore refuses an archive from the other engine."
msgstr "Tento archív obsahuje databázu %(there)s a táto inštancia používa %(here)s. Obnovenie odmietne archív z iného databázového systému."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/backup_restore.html
msgid "This archive was not signed by this instance's key: it was altered after it was written, or written under another key. Restore it only if you know where it has been; the command below asks for <code>--unverified</code> for that reason."
msgstr "Tento archív nebol podpísaný kľúčom tejto inštancie: po vytvorení bol zmenený alebo bol vytvorený s iným kľúčom. Obnovte ho, iba ak viete, kde bol; príkaz nižšie preto vyžaduje <code>--unverified</code>."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/backup_restore.html
#, python-format
msgid "This archive was written by Postulo %(there)s, which is newer than the one running here. Update first."
msgstr "Tento archív zapísalo Postulo %(there)s, ktoré je novšie ako to, ktoré beží tu. Najprv aktualizujte."

#: src/postulo/templates/core/partials/widget_offers.html
msgid "This arrangement is yours, and it starts out as the standard one. A widget added in a later release, or brought by a plugin, waits above until you say yes to it."
msgstr "Toto usporiadanie je vaše a na začiatku je štandardné. Prvok pridaný v neskoršom vydaní alebo zásuvným modulom čaká vyššie, kým ho neschválite."

#: src/postulo/templates/partials/table/narrow.html
msgid "This button applies the filters above it. The filters in the table's headers have a button of their own: apply one set before changing the other."
msgstr "Toto tlačidlo použije filtre nad ním. Filtre v hlavičkách tabuľky majú vlastné tlačidlo: použite jednu sadu skôr, než zmeníte druhú."

#: src/postulo/api/problems.py
msgid "This call needs a valid token."
msgstr "Toto volanie potrebuje platný token."

#: src/postulo/templates/partials/confirm_delete.html
msgid "This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Toto sa nedá vrátiť späť."

